From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Chatkord <noreply@example.invalid>
Date: Thu, 1 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] no-download: the build never fetches the engine

scripts/deps/webrtc.sh fetches the engine and refuses it unless its SHA-256 is the one stated
there; the crate's own download checks none, so it never runs. The helpers build.rs took from
webrtc-sys-build (the engine's directory, its definitions, the target's names) are written in
it, with no regex, and the build dependency goes. Android's arm needed that crate's NDK and
JNI helpers, and goes with them: the client builds for Linux and Windows.

